{"ref":"character:megalo-dracula","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Dracula is a secret playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. His starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Wine_Glass.png","w":15,"h":24,"r":"weapon:wine-glass"}," ",{"t":"Wine Glass","r":"weapon:wine-glass"},", but he also has the option of starting with ",{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Agony.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dominus-agony"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Agony","r":"weapon:dominus-agony"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Anger.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dominus-anger"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Anger","r":"weapon:dominus-anger"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Hatred.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dominus-hatred"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Hatred","r":"weapon:dominus-hatred"}," all at once if Dominus Agony has been unlocked, as well as the ",{"i":"Sprite-Ebony_Diabologue.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:ebony-diabologue"}," ",{"t":"Ebony Diabologue","r":"weapon:ebony-diabologue"}," regardless of unlock status."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Dracula"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_DRACULA_MEGA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_MegaloDracula_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Wine_Glass.png","w":10,"h":16,"r":"weapon:wine-glass"}," ",{"t":"Wine Glass","r":"weapon:wine-glass"}]]},{"label":"Hidden weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Hand_of_Vlad.png","w":16,"h":14,"r":"weapon:hand-of-vlad"}," ",{"t":"Hand of Vlad","r":"weapon:hand-of-vlad"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Hold the stones that birthed your lineage and prove you hold dominance over all your monstrous minions."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 16,650"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Castlevania_Symphony_of_the_Night.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Dance of Illusions\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["666"]]},{"label":"Armor","cells":[["+2"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Might","cells":[["+250%"]]},{"label":"Cooldown","cells":[["-20%"]]},{"label":"Greed","cells":[["+100%"]]},{"label":"Reroll","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Skip","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Banish","cells":[["+10"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":21,"h":21,"a":"A sprite icon representing Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane linking to Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," \"Hold the stones that birthed your lineage and prove you hold dominance over all your monstrous minions.\"\nFull unlock method hidden. Click \"Show Details\" to unhide."]},{"k":"p","c":["After obtaining both the ",{"i":"Sprite-Ebony_and_Crimson_Stones.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:ebony-and-crimson-stones"}," ",{"t":"Ebony and Crimson Stones","r":"relic:ebony-and-crimson-stones"}," and the ",{"i":"Sprite-Pile_of_Secrets.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"}," ",{"t":"Pile of Secrets","r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"},", the player must start a run in ",{"t":"Ode to Castlevania","r":"stage:ode-to-castlevania-stage"}," while playing as ",{"i":"Sprite-Vlad_Tepes_Dracula.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"}," ",{"t":"Vlad Tepes Dracula","r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"}," and kill a total of 100,000 enemies or more in a single run. Doing this unlocks Megalo Dracula as a playable character."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once unlocked, Megalo Dracula can be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 16,650, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Megalo Dracula can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"mathiascronqvist\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Dracula starts with the following bonuses:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["+566 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}]},{"c":["+2 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}]},{"c":["+50% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}]},{"c":["+250% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"}]},{"c":["-20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"}]},{"c":["+100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Greed.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"powerup:greed"}," ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"}]},{"c":["+10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:reroll"}," ",{"t":"Reroll","r":"powerup:reroll"}]},{"c":["+10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Skip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:skip"}," ",{"t":"Skip","r":"powerup:skip"}]},{"c":["+10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"}]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Dracula is the permanent transformation ",{"i":"Sprite-Vlad_Tepes_Dracula.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"}," ",{"t":"Vlad Tepes Dracula","r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"}," receives upon reaching level 80. Like his normal form, he gains +1% Might per level and +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"powerup:revival"}," every 100 levels. There is no cap on these bonuses. Every +1% of ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"}," increases his Might by +1%, incoming damage is capped at 10, and he is also immune to health drain. Additionally, the transformation also grants Vlad Tepes Dracula the ",{"i":"Sprite-Hand_of_Vlad.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"weapon:hand-of-vlad"}," ",{"t":"Hand of Vlad","r":"weapon:hand-of-vlad"}," as a hidden weapon, which grants him two giant claws to his left and right that swipe at nearby enemies."]},{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Dracula can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Dracula.png","w":120,"h":59,"c":["Megalo Dracula's sprite"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 11 February 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Secrets for OTC Megalo characters show up before getting the Pile of Secrets"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["hotfix 28 May 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Megalo Dracula not receiving stats on level up."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The Spell for unlocking Megalo Dracula is a direct reference to Dracula's former name when he was a mortal known as Mathias Cronqvist."]},{"c":["Megalo Dracula is a direct reference to Dracula's appearance when he is fought as the final boss of ",{"t":"Castlevania: Symphony of the Night","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Castlevania:_Symphony_of_the_Night"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k"